Model weights
-------------
The pretrained weights (s2tok_252.pt) are distributed separately at
https://huggingface.co/AppliedIntuitionResearch/S2Tok under CC BY-NC 4.0, non-commercial use
only; see WEIGHTS_LICENSE.md. They are fine-tuned from the released ZipSplat checkpoint
(https://huggingface.co/veichta/zipsplat, CC BY-NC 4.0), which is initialized from DA3-Giant
(https://huggingface.co/depth-anything/DA3-GIANT, ByteDance, CC BY-NC 4.0). Depth labels used in
training were produced with DA3-Nested-Giant-Large
(https://huggingface.co/depth-anything/DA3NESTED-GIANT-LARGE, CC BY-NC 4.0). The weights were
trained on DL3DV-10K (https://github.com/DL3DV-10K/Dataset, DL3DV-10K Terms of Use and
CC BY-NC 4.0, non-commercial research and education only) and RealEstate10K
(https://google.github.io/realestate10k/). No training data is distributed with the code or
the weights.

The teaser animations in assets/teaser/ show scenes from Mip-NeRF 360
(https://jonbarron.info/mipnerf360/) and are not covered by the licenses above.
